OL,3,GNEWSAWhy we should 'burn Roberts, not
OL,4,AGuys' on Bonfire Night
OL,5,
OL,6,FThink of the Gunpowder Plot and you
OL,7,Fprobably picture Guy Fawkes and barrels
OL,8,Fof explosives beneath the Houses of
OL,9,FParliament.
OL,11,FBut Northamptonshire?
OL,13,FThe county played a central but often
OL,14,Foverlooked part of the story, according
OL,15,Fto Tudor and medieval historian Dr
OL,16,FElizabeth Norton.
OL,18,FShe says that while Guy Fawkes, from
OL,19,FYork, became the plot's "poster boy"
OL,20,Fafter being caught in the cellars
OL,21,Fbeneath Parliament, there is much more
OL,22,Fto the story.
